#: applications/luci-app-igmpproxy-plus/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/igmpproxy/settings.js:7
msgid ""
"<b>Off</b>: RFC behaviour, keep forwarding until the last member queries "
"time out (count x interval). <b>On</b>: stop forwarding on that interface as "
"soon as any host leaves; other hosts re-join within milliseconds after the "
"follow-up query. Best for one receiver per port, IPTV set-top boxes. "
"<b>Auto</b>: stop at once when the last known host on that interface leaves, "
"otherwise do the RFC check. Needs a switch with IGMP snooping so hosts do "
"not suppress each other's reports."
msgstr ""

